<title>DENMARK: Den Danske to issue $500 mln U.S. bond.</title>
<headline>Den Danske to issue $500 mln U.S. bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Den Danske Bank said on Friday that it planned to issue a $500 million 13-year U.S. bond as a private placement with institutional investors.  </p>
<p>A statement from the bank said that the issue, to raise tier-two capital, would be at a fixed rate of interest for the first 10 years and a variable rate, linked to LIBOR. thereafter.</p>
<p>It did not say what the initial coupon would be. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
